commit c97539da0e8554d2fad90cc79692381eab1c7906
Author: GoodOlClint <goodolclint@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Aug 6 17:38:39 2026 -0500

    Olmo3: fix newCache signature so the sliding-window cache is actually used (#462)
    
    Fix Olmo3's `newCache(parameters:)` to properly override the `LanguageModel` protocol (it had a non-optional parameter, so it was an unused overload — `sliding_attention` layers got an unbounded cache instead of a rotating one).
    
    Also add cached-forward smoke tests covering all models with bespoke `newCache` or hybrid cache layouts (Olmo3, Jamba, GraniteMoeHybrid, Qwen3Next, GPTOSS, BaichuanM1, MiMoV2Flash, AfMoE, Exaone4, Mistral3Text) — each verifies attention-layer caches advance by exactly the token count, catching offset/double-update bugs.

