    Qwen2.5-VL / Qwen2-VL: windowed prefill + state-threaded warm continuation (#448)
    
    Wires the #399 mechanism through Qwen2.5-VL and Qwen2-VL per the #420
    checklist: getRopeIndex gains an offset-aware positionOffset, prepare
    consumes the incoming LMOutput.State and delegates warm/oversized
    prompts to a chunked prepareContinuation anchored at the carried rope
    delta, and the returned resume state threads the following turn through
    the existing decode reconstruction. Adds random-weight continuation
    tests for both models mirroring Qwen35ContinuationTests.

